{"channelId":"UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","row":["The Marty and Laura Show",205,"Dr. Marty Greer and Laura Reeves deliver unique, fun, and fact-based conversations about pet health. Greer is the 2023 Westminster Kennel Club Veterinarian of the Year and the author of Your Pandemic Puppy. Reeves is the host of the widely popular, award-winning Pure Dog Talk podcast.\n\nFrom pro tips on selecting your new dog to understanding what your dog’s runny eyes or your cat’s runny nose mean—and what you should do about it—Marty and Laura meet you where you are (in the car, on the treadmill, or walking the dog) and bring you a good laugh, a great story, and a bright idea every week.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:56.072Z","channelId":"UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"4d18472b5939e7b5481cac1a658b4bf9b491df672edb97303eacb340daa803c4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a8b928de5f8c9ac0d7e008686f360cf223b0df56dde76a3b875f210a8807419d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:56.072Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":205,"raw":"205 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMPUlmZQ9y9RLrC2Hv7xjtw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:56.072Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RCH0B16OAwA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本